      "paragraphs": [
        "The built-in types that hand out no catalog leaf at all - the type-level mirror of the built-in types whose `leaf` is `'none'`. Their assets load directly (`loader.load(Asset.type('music', ...))`) but cannot be held by a catalog, inferred from a bare path, or handed out by `get()`."
